+  /*************************************************************************/
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* The following functions are used by default with TrueType fonts.      */
+  /* However, they can be replaced by alternatives if we need to support   */
+  /* TrueType-compressed formats (like MicroType) in the future.           */
+  /*                                                                       */
