+	is always FALSE).
+
+	* src/cache/ftccmap.c: Include FT_INTERNAL_OBJECTS_H to use
+	TRUE/FALSE macros.
+	(ftc_cmap_node_compare): New argument `FT_Bool* list_changed' to
