+	`num_kern_tables', `kern_avail_bits', `kern_order_bits' if
+	FT_OPTIMIZE_MEMORY is set.
+	Don't define `hdmx', `num_kern_pairs', `kern_table_index',
+	`kern_pairs' if FT_OPTIMIZE_MEMORY is set.
