+  /*    FT_Done_FreeType                                                   */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Description>                                                         */
+  /*    Destroy a given FreeType library object and all of its children,   */
+  /*    including resources, drivers, faces, sizes, etc.                   */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Input>                                                               */
+  /*    library :: A handle to the target library object.                  */
+  /*                                                                       */
