+  /*************************************************************************/
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Function>                                                            */
+  /*    FT_Get_Name_Index                                                  */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Description>                                                         */
+  /*    Return the glyph index of a given glyph name.  This function uses  */
+  /*    driver specific objects to do the translation.                     */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Input>                                                               */
+  /*    face       :: A handle to the source face object.                  */
+  /*                                                                       */
